# ReasoningBank / AgentDB — isolated dev tooling (tools/reasoningbank).
# The STORE holds learned trajectories and their embeddings. It is derived data,
# never source: it is machine-local, regenerable, and must not be committed or
# published. See tools/reasoningbank/package.json for the isolation contract and
# .planning/ROADMAP.md Phase 2 for the supply-chain review this install inherits.
.agentdb/
*.agentdb
tools/reasoningbank/*.db
tools/reasoningbank/*.db-journal
tools/reasoningbank/*.db-wal
tools/reasoningbank/*.db-shm
tools/reasoningbank/store/
.pnpm-store/

