# Supabase temp
supabase/.temp/
# The whole supabase/ mirror was DELETED from the tree in 2433137 (the gateway
# now lives in apps/gateway). A local leftover copy survived and it carries a REAL
# .env - DATABASE_URL, GATEWAY_SHARED_SECRET, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY - that was
# never committed but was NOT ignored, so one git add -A would have committed
# production secrets. Audit AUD-069.
#
# ANCHORED to the repo root on purpose. An unanchored `supabase/` matches a
# directory named `supabase` at ANY depth - including
# `apps/web/src/lib/supabase/`, which is tracked, live web code. A new file
# written there was silently UNTRACKED and ignored: `git add` refused it with
# "ignored by one of your .gitignore files" while the file sat in the working
# tree looking perfectly version-controlled. The mirror is at the root, so
# root it.
/supabase/

